  "description": "The Kanzo E, abbreviated for Electric, is our robust Allroad electric bike. From a relaxed ride to work, a gravel challenge, or just a convenient city bike: our Kanzo E can do it all! We opted for the Fazua Evation system here because it's light and very responsive. Nice features for an aluminum bike! The system has a 250W motor and a 252Wh battery. The Fazua motor can provide a boost of up to 400W extra, perfect for conquering even the steepest slopes. With 60Nm torque, you also get optimal support when accelerating after each turn. The Kanzo E reflects our years of experience. The longer wheelbase gives you a stable feeling, even on the most challenging paths.",
